## Baseline Assessment

| Metric | Before (v2.11.0) | Target (v3.0.0) |
|--------|-------------------|-----------------|
| Framework self-test | 21/21 PASS | 24+/24 PASS |
| Reconciliation inconsistencies | 42 | 0 |
| Stale gate sessions | 23 orphaned | 0 (auto-drained) |
| Transaction monotonicity | ❌ non-monotonic (rev 25 duplicate) | ✅ strictly monotonic |
| opencode.json | ❌ absent | ✅ adapter present |
| Plugin enforcement | ❌ absent | ✅ framework-enforcer.ts |
| Custom tools | ❌ absent | ✅ 3 compliance tools |
| Health check | ❌ absent | ✅ framework-doctor.js --strict |
| Rule registry | ⚠️ requires manual regen | ✅ auto-verify + CI |
| Hook enforcement | ⚠️ manual git config | ✅ install-hooks.js idempotent |
